{"id":"a5213da99983a05a","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-bisimulation-invariance.md","title":"Bisimulation Invariance","display":"lem-bisimulation-invariance — Bisimulation Invariance","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-bisimulation-invariance","aliases":["89-lem-bisimulation-invariance"],"display":"lem-bisimulation-invariance — Bisimulation Invariance","depends_on":["[[89-df-bisimulation]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-bisimulation-invariance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-bisimulation-invariance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-bisimulation-invariance — Bisimulation Invariance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f233d5485efaad7c\" href=\"?note=f233d5485efaad7c\" title=\"89-df-bisimulation\">89-df-bisimulation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)\">\\(\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{N}=(W&#39;,R&#39;,V&#39;)\">\\(\\mathcal{N}=(W&#39;,R&#39;,V&#39;)\\)</span> are Kripke models.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\subseteq W\\times W&#39;\">\\(Z\\subseteq W\\times W&#39;\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(w,v)\\in Z\">\\((w,v)\\in Z\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}bisimulation\\text{-}invariance}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\varphi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{N},v\\models\\varphi\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}bisimulation\\text{-}invariance}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\varphi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{N},v\\models\\varphi\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> : 互模拟关系 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f233d5485efaad7c\" href=\"?note=f233d5485efaad7c\" title=\"89-df-bisimulation\">89-df-bisimulation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> : 模态满足</li>\n<li>互模拟的点满足相同的模态公式</li>\n<li>模态逻辑的语义不变性</li>\n<li>证明对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 作结构归纳；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 情形分别使用 forth 与 back\n条件，并在匹配的后继点应用归纳假设。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-bisimulation","status":"resolved","id":"f233d5485efaad7c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bisimulation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-bisimulation","status":"resolved","id":"f233d5485efaad7c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$Z$ : 互模拟关系 (see [[89-df-bisimulation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{N}=(W',R',V')","display":false},{"tex":"Z\\subseteq W\\times W'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)","display":false},{"tex":"(w,v)\\in Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}bisimulation\\text{-}invariance}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\varphi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{N},v\\models\\varphi\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false}],"bytes":1180,"backlinks":[{"id":"f233d5485efaad7c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-bisimulation-invariance]]：双模拟不变性定理"},{"id":"6983c729bb4a6b9e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"这是 [[89-lem-bisimulation-invariance]] 对公式 $\\Box\\varphi$ 的实例；\n不能只从 forth/back 条件跳过对子公式 $\\varphi$ 的归纳假设。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-421","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-bisimulation-invariance]]"}],"outgoing":["f233d5485efaad7c","56c1b5b75a32ca1d","ab746eb779e20ce0","9f00301866fbd6f0"]}